                     heading, and 15 waves (including the latest) named the tail
                     in Russian, and for them the command prints only the file name.
                     the tail itself is now printed by the handover command below
  tri mutants-logic-refresh [DRY=1] — rebuild .trinity/build/QueenCore with the default
                     toolchain and run make mutants-logic (toolchain mismatch)
  tri deploy-wait (alias: tri live-wait) <path> <marker> [N] — wait until the edit reaches the live render
  tri tb            — TurboBaby: production summary + separation from woody-weed-bot
  tri tb-deploy     — safe deploy of turbobaby-bot (link→up→wait→verify)
  tri tb-verify     — separation invariants: vars/migrations/foreign health
  tri tb-lint       — both CI clippy gates locally (+ --test for cargo test)
  tri live-verify [issue] [crit] — live fingerprint of the chain in one run
  tri regression [issue] [crit] — board + locks + live-verify in one command
  tri spec-diag [log] — error class of every spec that does not build
  tri jobs         — campaign status in one line (guards/urgent/iterations)
  tri jobs-run     — one loop iteration: preflight → sync → anomalies → dashboard
  tri jobs-guards  — prove the guards before sending (exit 1 = do not send)
  tri jobs-next    — what to do next, by descending payoff
  tri jobs-owed    — who is waiting for a reply, oldest debt first
  tri jobs-board   — funnel by stage
  tri jobs-show X  — one whole conversation, both sides
  tri jobs-dash [open] — rebuild the dashboard (and open it)
