    # The name is not `board`: `tri board` (above) draws the trios dashboard from
    # iterations.jsonl and STATUS.md — a different question and a different source.
    # Exit 2 = the instruments are split, or one reads a board that stands still
    # while another one moves. That is an answer, not a failure.
    #   tri which-board [--json] [--no-gh] [--selftest]
